        "evidence_id": "E010",
        "passage_id": "P007",
        "quote": "Accordingly, we agree with the Supreme Court's denial of the respective motions of South Country and the Iaboni defendants for summary judgment dismissing the second amended complaint and all cross claims insofar as asserted against each of them.",
